,"Mary with child, the saints Jerome and Francis of Assisi and four angels",1450,0,0,null,0,null,null,null,0,0,null,"Maria met kind, de heiligen Hiëronymus en Fransiscus van Assisi en vier engelen",null],[123027159,"Madonna with Child and Angels",null,0,0,null,0,"a/aa/Sano_di_pietro%2C_madonna_col_bambino_e_con_angeli%2C_1450_ca.JPG/330px-Sano_di_pietro%2C_madonna_col_bambino_e_con_angeli%2C_1450_ca.JPG",2,1,1,0,36,null,null],[123027187,"Madonna with Angels",1450,0,0,null,0,"e/e4/Sano_di_pietro%2C_madonna_con_angeli%2C_1450_ca.JPG/330px-Sano_di_pietro%2C_madonna_con_angeli%2C_1450_ca.JPG",2,1,1,0,36,null,null],[123460435,"Jungfrau mit Kind, Heiligen und zwei Engeln",null,0,0,null,0,"9/90/Sano_di_pietro%2C_madonna_col_bambino%2C_santi_e_due_angeli.JPG/330px-Sano_di_pietro%2C_madonna_col_bambino%2C_santi_e_due_angeli.JPG",2,1,1,0,7,"madonna col bambino, santi e due angeli",null],[126329834,"Painted Crucifix",null,0,0,null,1,null,null,null,0,1,3,"crocifisso dipinto",null],[131546499,"Nozze gentilizie",null,0,0,null,0,null,null,null,0,1,42,null,null],[131674332,"Coronation of Mary",null,0,0,null,0,null,null,null,0,1,43,null,null],[131690603,"Madonna with Saints",null,0,0,null,0,null,null,null,0,1,43,null,null],[131851094,"Life of Saint Bernardino",null,0,0,null,0,null,null,null,0,1,11,null,null],[134367657,"Santi Giorgio e Cristina (Bolsena)",null,0,0,null,0,"f/f6/Bolsena%2C_s._cristina%2C_chiesa_maggiore%2C_int.%2C_polittico_di_sano_di_pietro_01.JPG/330px-Bolsena%2C_s._cristina%2C_chiesa_maggiore%2C_int.%2C_polittico_di_sano_di_pietro_01.JPG",2,1,1,0,44,null,null],[135284107,"Saint Agatha",1445,0,0,null,0,"b/b3/Duccio_-_Sainte_Agathe.jpg/330px-Duccio_-_Sainte_Agathe.jpg",1,7,1,2,45,"Sainte Agathe | Sainte Agatha","10.10"],[135435031,"Auferstehender Christus",1444,0,0,null,0,"e/ee/Auferstehender_Christus_-_Sano_di_Pietro_-_Wallraf-Richartz-Museum_%26_Fondation_Corboud-2180_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Auferstehender_Christus_-_Sano_di_Pietro_-_Wallraf-Richartz-Museum_%26_Fondation_Corboud-2180_%28cropped%29.jpg",1,0,1,1,46,null,"WRM 0726"],[141190327,"Painted Reliquary tablet",1460,0,0,null,0,null,null,null,0,0,22,null,"Gal.-Nr. 24"],[141190624,"Man of Sorrows",1455,0,0,null,0,null,null,null,0,0,22,null,"Gal.-Nr. 31"]],"summaryBase":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/","summaryLicence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","summaries":{"18923445":["Nativity of the Virgin is a 1438–1439 tempera on panel painting, now in the Museum of Sacred Art in Ascanio, Province of Siena, Tuscany, Italy. It forms the central panel of a multi-panel altarpiece, the rest of which shows episodes from the life of the Virgin Mary.","Nativity of the Virgin (Sano di Pietro)"],"19606385":["The Angel of the Annunciation is a 1440s tempera and gold-leaf on poplar panel painting by Sano di Pietro, now in the Musée du Petit Palais in Avignon. It probably formed the left wing of a diptych, with the former right panel of the Virgin Mary in the Duke of Norfolk's collection at Arundel Castle.","The Angel of the Annunciation"],"19947578":["Saint Bernardino Heals Donna Perna is a tempera and gold left on panel painting by Sano di Pietro, produced after 1450 and now in a private collection. It and two other panels originally formed a predella.","Saint Bernardino Heals Donna Perna"],"19947635":["The Gesuati Altarpiece is a 1444 tempera and gold on poplar panel altarpiece by Sano di Pietro, produced for San Girolamo, a Jesuati monastery in Siena.","Gesuati Altarpiece"],"19947782":["The Madonna of the Cherry is a 1445 tempera and gold on panel painting by Sano di Pietro, now in the Fort Charlet in Calvi on Corsica. The cherry is a symbol of paradise, with its red colour evoking Christ's future passion.","Madonna of the Cherry"],"20087556":["Saint Bernardino Preaching is a 1445 tempera on panel painting of Bernardino of Siena by Sano di Pietro. It was originally made up of several panels, of which two are now in the Museo dell'Opera del Duomo in Siena.","Saint Bernardino Preaching (Sano di Pietro)"],"99457692":["The Childhood of Saint John the Baptist or Saint John the Baptist Meets his Parents is a 1450 oil on panel painting by Sano di Pietro, showing John the Baptist, Zacharias and Elizabeth.","The Childhood of Saint John the Baptist"],"112873050":["Madonna and Child is a 15th-century oil on panel painting by Sano di Pietro. Since 2001 it has been in the musée des Beaux-Arts de Quimper, in Quimper.","Madonna and Child (Sano di Pietro)"],"135284107":["Saint Agatha is a c.1445-1450 vertical tempera and gold on panel painting of Agatha of Sicily by Sano di Pietro, probably from a larger altarpiece.","Saint Agatha (Sano di Pietro)"]},"titlesFrom":["fr","P1476","alias:en","alias:fr","aliasFilter:1"]}